// ASSAULT — the font and the unit icons, embedded as base64.
//
// They are NOT loaded as separate files, and the reason is not tidiness:
// drawing an image fetched over file:// taints the canvas, and a tainted
// canvas makes toDataURL() throw — that is every PNG export on the page,
// gone. A data: URI taints nothing, so the icons have to travel inside a
// script. Font: Roboto Slab (Apache 2.0), latin subset, variable 100-900:
// one file covers regular and bold. Icons: the PNGs in the folder.
//
// This file is GENERATED from the originals in the repo root. To rebuild
// it, see CLAUDE.md.
window.ASSAULT_ASSETS = {
  font: 'data:font/woff2;base64,',
  icons: {
    S: 'data:image/png;base64,',
    R: 'data:image/png;base64,',
    A: 'data:image/png;base64,',
    C: 'data:image/png;base64,'
  }
};
